config ZT9101_USB
	tristate "ZTop ZT9101 USB WiFi support"
	depends on USB && CFG80211
	help
	  Driver for the ZTop ZT9101 USB WiFi adapter used on the Xifan
	  XF55H handheld. Firmware and the vendor cfg file are read from
	  /lib/firmware/zt9101 (path set via modprobe.d).

	  Say M to build it as a module.
